(6074307, 894345, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fantastic clarity. I like the background as a light blue, gives a feeling of being in ice. Also like the balance of the two main subjects in the photo.</td>', 'Fantastic clarity. I like the background as a light blue, gives a feeling of being in ice. Also like the balance of the two main subjects in the photo.', '2010-06-30 11:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074309, 893927, 114225, '<td valign="top">Intriguing. Cute little bottle! Nice use of a coin background, with the lighting, it almost feels like a rising moon.</td>', 'Intriguing. Cute little bottle! Nice use of a coin background, with the lighting, it almost feels like a rising moon.', '2010-06-30 11:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074311, 894499, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I''m not so sure about the lighting here. It''s a neat effect coming through the one bottle, but there a bit too much light spill onto other areas of the background.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I''m not so sure about the lighting here. It''s a neat effect coming through the one bottle, but there a bit too much light spill onto other areas of the background.', '2010-06-30 11:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074312, 894228, 114225, '<td valign="top">Is this to get kids to start drinking at an early age? Nice overall setup, the dark water spots give the photo the extra texture it needs.</td>', 'Is this to get kids to start drinking at an early age? Nice overall setup, the dark water spots give the photo the extra texture it needs.', '2010-06-30 11:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074313, 893757, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, nice photo. Some suggestions I would have would be to have the olive even more in focus (to my eyes, it looks a bit soft), and maybe slightly different lighting (being able to see the circle of light on the background is a little distracting).</td>', 'Overall, nice photo. Some suggestions I would have would be to have the olive even more in focus (to my eyes, it looks a bit soft), and maybe slightly different lighting (being able to see the circle of light on the background is a little distracting).', '2010-06-30 11:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
