(6076230, 894519, 43774, '<td valign="top">Clever!! I''d like to know how you did this within the rules.<br/> <br/>Well, now that it has been validated, my only guess is that the star outline of the bottle is on glass that is in front of the sky. I can see some blurriness around the bottle so perhaps that from shooting behind glass. Or maybe you made the stars with a flashlight and the blurriness is the movement from the person in front of the camera. Either way, it''s still cool.</td>', 'Clever!! I''d like to know how you did this within the rules. Well, now that it has been validated, my only guess is that the star outline of the bottle is on glass that is in front of the sky. I can see some blurriness around the bottle so perhaps that from shooting behind glass. Or maybe you made the stars with a flashlight and the blurriness is the movement from the person in front of the camera. Either way, it''s still cool.', '2010-07-01 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
