(6077243, 894511, 68947, '<td valign="top">Fabulous idea!  Really different than the rest who literally did a studio shot...which are skillful but, not creative.  My *ONLY* critique would be that a bottle of alcohol on a child may not sit well with some people.  It may have been better to have placed it on an adult''s back.  However, I love it and it has a 9 from me! :)</td>', 'Fabulous idea!  Really different than the rest who literally did a studio shot...which are skillful but, not creative.  My *ONLY* critique would be that a bottle of alcohol on a child may not sit well with some people.  It may have been better to have placed it on an adult''s back.  However, I love it and it has a 9 from me! :)', '2010-07-02 12:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077254, 894324, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really cute and must have taken sometime to do!  Love the angle and the background. I saw an Absolut advertisement similar to this idea prior to the challenge and thought it was clever then.  8 from me. :)</td>', 'Really cute and must have taken sometime to do!  Love the angle and the background. I saw an Absolut advertisement similar to this idea prior to the challenge and thought it was clever then.  8 from me. :)', '2010-07-02 12:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
