(6077270, 894337, 68947, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that this isn''t doing as well as you''d like but, it has a message that may be "double sided".  On the one hand, it''s about breast cancer awareness but, it''s advertising alcohol.  Then, again...it could be looked upon as what to stay AWAY from in breast cancer awareness too.  It''s one of those shots that make you want to scratch your head and ask yourself if you like or dis-like it? LOL  7 for the idea and effort you put into this.</td>', 'I''m sure that this isn''t doing as well as you''d like but, it has a message that may be "double sided".  On the one hand, it''s about breast cancer awareness but, it''s advertising alcohol.  Then, again...it could be looked upon as what to stay AWAY from in breast cancer awareness too.  It''s one of those shots that make you want to scratch your head and ask yourself if you like or dis-like it? LOL  7 for the idea and effort you put into this.', '2010-07-02 12:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077277, 894309, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL...out of the box thinking in a way and yet right on target because you got the bottle in there!  Must have taken some effort to do it too!  My only critiques would be that it''s a little darkened though I realize that the light you were working with wasn''t optimal.  7</td>', 'LOL...out of the box thinking in a way and yet right on target because you got the bottle in there!  Must have taken some effort to do it too!  My only critiques would be that it''s a little darkened though I realize that the light you were working with wasn''t optimal.  7', '2010-07-02 12:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
