(6079244, 893384, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice refreshing photo, is that a bottle of Absolut in the background?</td>', 'Nice refreshing photo, is that a bottle of Absolut in the background?', '2010-07-04 00:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079262, 894465, 13688, '<td valign="top">The object in the upper left confuses me...but perhaps it also breaks up the concept of just water.  I do find it intriguing how you created the bottle itself...if it really is water, i''m guessing it was complicated.  I would have been lazy and just used small droplets that formed the shape.  I studied the glass on the mirror a bit more and i like how the droplet on the mirror coincides with the reflected rim of the glass...intentional?...trippy.-8</td>', 'The object in the upper left confuses me...but perhaps it also breaks up the concept of just water.  I do find it intriguing how you created the bottle itself...if it really is water, i''m guessing it was complicated.  I would have been lazy and just used small droplets that formed the shape.  I studied the glass on the mirror a bit more and i like how the droplet on the mirror coincides with the reflected rim of the glass...intentional?...trippy.-8', '2010-07-04 00:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079277, 894361, 91372, '<td valign="top">stunning. 9</td>', 'stunning. 9', '2010-07-04 00:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079278, 894322, 91372, '<td valign="top">where is this???? (8)</td>', 'where is this???? (8)', '2010-07-04 00:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079280, 893996, 91372, '<td valign="top">after you get top 3 in this competition could you pleeeaaase explain what your lighting was like for this?</td>', 'after you get top 3 in this competition could you pleeeaaase explain what your lighting was like for this?', '2010-07-04 00:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079286, 894361, 13688, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Strange thing for me though is that the shot doesn''t feel calm at all.  It feels extremely dynamic with all the bottles at different heights and angles and distances to the camera.  I think it reminds me of my new york street scenes which tend to have a lot of different planes.  I really like the composition, but to be picky I would have made sure the reflection of the disco wasn''t infringing so much on the mandrin.  Anyway, thanks for sharing -9</td>', 'Nice idea.  Strange thing for me though is that the shot doesn''t feel calm at all.  It feels extremely dynamic with all the bottles at different heights and angles and distances to the camera.  I think it reminds me of my new york street scenes which tend to have a lot of different planes.  I really like the composition, but to be picky I would have made sure the reflection of the disco wasn''t infringing so much on the mandrin.  Anyway, thanks for sharing -9', '2010-07-04 00:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079302, 894519, 13688, '<td valign="top">great idea...i feel like the martini glass should be doing something more interesting...something that makes me feel like it was looking longingly to its home galaxy.  maybe if it was just tilted somehow toward it...maybe 2 martini glasses to represent a couple star gazing would have done it for me...  sorry  to be annoying.-9</td>', 'great idea...i feel like the martini glass should be doing something more interesting...something that makes me feel like it was looking longingly to its home galaxy.  maybe if it was just tilted somehow toward it...maybe 2 martini glasses to represent a couple star gazing would have done it for me...  sorry  to be annoying.-9', '2010-07-04 01:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079305, 894361, 47294, '<td valign="top">That''s incredible, I love it!  Front page form me, best of luck. 10 and a fav.</td>', 'That''s incredible, I love it!  Front page form me, best of luck. 10 and a fav.', '2010-07-04 01:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079342, 894230, 63812, '<td valign="top">clean +sharp + water +drops +excellent lights = Irene and a ribbon :-)</td>', 'clean +sharp + water +drops +excellent lights = Irene and a ribbon :-)', '2010-07-04 01:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079404, 894409, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not bad but the light really needed to be shaped like the bottle to work, IMO. As a result the trick is just a sideshow.</td>', 'Not bad but the light really needed to be shaped like the bottle to work, IMO. As a result the trick is just a sideshow.', '2010-07-04 05:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079405, 893686, 41337, '<td valign="top">Saw this idea on the net but this is better executed.</td>', 'Saw this idea on the net but this is better executed.', '2010-07-04 05:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079406, 893845, 41337, '<td valign="top">Snappy colors. Looks good.</td>', 'Snappy colors. Looks good.', '2010-07-04 05:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079407, 894526, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I think the presentation could have been cleaner had you cloned out the streaks of light in front of the bottle and brighten the text so it''s easier to read. Another option would be to fired a flash thru the bottle from behind with a snoot that way you keep the sparklers from blowing out while making the bottle pop. Or cover the bottle in cinefoil that way the bottle remains completely black leaving just a sparkler silhouette. Anyway, just some thoughts. Overall, the execution is pretty good. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice idea. I think the presentation could have been cleaner had you cloned out the streaks of light in front of the bottle and brighten the text so it''s easier to read. Another option would be to fired a flash thru the bottle from behind with a snoot that way you keep the sparklers from blowing out while making the bottle pop. Or cover the bottle in cinefoil that way the bottle remains completely black leaving just a sparkler silhouette. Anyway, just some thoughts. Overall, the execution is pretty good. Good luck.', '2010-07-04 05:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079408, 894357, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks great. I get that the bowtie makes sense where its located but visually it looks more like a hair bow.</td>', 'Looks great. I get that the bowtie makes sense where its located but visually it looks more like a hair bow.', '2010-07-04 05:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079410, 894230, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks good. Curious, why not shoot the water from behind?</td>', 'Looks good. Curious, why not shoot the water from behind?', '2010-07-04 05:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
